    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i been having really bad muscle cramps at night and im also having trouble sleeping lately. i read that magnesium helps a lot with that. i know i have some mild chronic kidney disease (ckd stage 2) but i wanted to know how much magnesium i should take to actually feel a difference? like what's a good dose to start with to get quick relief?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
